  "steps": [
    "75g raw pasta, 1 small onion, 1 small tomato, 300ml water, 1/2 tsp salt, Cover and Boil for 20 min on medium flame, keep the lid slightly open.",
    "Meanwhile make your sauce: 200g low fat paneer, 4 cloves of garlic (8 is super garlicky!!), 1 red chilli (3 is recommending in the original recipe), 1/4 tsp salt, 200ml milk, Blend it.",
    "Once the pasta absorbs majority of the water, add the sauce to the pasta and cook it on low flame for about 5 to 10 min.",
    "Finally sprinkle some oregano."
